# Grid Wars 2 on Miyoo Flip (no analog sticks)
# D-pad            = move (W A S D)
# Face buttons     = fire direction (arrow keys) - positional: top=up, bottom=down, left=left, right=right
#                    press two together for diagonal fire
# L1 / R1          = bomb (space)
# L2 / R2          = enter (menus)
# Start            = esc (options menu)
# Select + Start   = quit (handled by gptokeyb)
up = w
down = s
left = a
right = d
y = up
a = down
x = left
b = right
l1 = space
r1 = space
l2 = enter
r2 = enter
start = esc
